
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 9.1. Edukas tellimus — 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": 1,
  "qty": 2,
  "buyer": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 9.2. Vigane tellimus — 422 Unprocessable Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": 1,
  "qty": 0,
  "buyer": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 9.3. Vabu kohti ei ole — 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": 2,
  "qty": 1,
  "buyer": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}
